    alertmanager-main-db-alertmanager-main-1   Bound    pvc-767a62fc-20dd-4d20-a381-a7fc54865abc   10Gi       RWO            thin           120d
    prometheus-k8s-db-prometheus-k8s-0         Bound    pvc-0ad8c864-d259-456c-9998-56c78e483115   100Gi      RWO            thin           120d
    prometheus-k8s-db-prometheus-k8s-1         Bound    pvc-1fcf280e-dd47-4c9f-8e8b-17d910c82bf2   100Gi      RWO            thin           182d
    test                                       Bound    pvc-c9dd0d80-78ec-4e90-af0f-0cbac3a2fa61   5Gi        RWO            thin           20d
